yXxx` method on an entity for a given event.\nConvention: method name = `apply` + event class short name (case-sensitive).\n\nPer (entityClass, eventClass) pair the dispatcher caches a class-scoped Closure\n(bound via Closure::bind to the entity's class scope) so subsequent dispatches\nskip ReflectionMethod::invoke and use direct dynamic dispatch \u2014 only the first\nresolution touches reflection.\n\nCross-namespace short-name collisions throw ApplyMethodAmbiguousException at\nresolution time.\";}}s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000fileReference\";r:1;}}s:18:\"functionReferences\";a:0:{}s:8:\"filepath\";s:71:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-ddd-core\/src\/Aggregate\/Internal\/ApplyDispatcher.php\";s:12:\"dependencies\";a:5:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:7:\"Closure\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:71:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-ddd-core\/src\/Aggregate\/Internal\/ApplyDispatcher.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:7;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";E:54:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyType:USE\";}}i:1;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:42:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Ddd\\Core\\Entity\\DomainEvent\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:71:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-ddd-core\/src\/Aggregate\/Internal\/ApplyDispatch