ose input is\n   this Policy's output. The composed result is itself a Policy, so\n   chains are first-class domain objects that can be passed, swapped,\n   and tested as a whole.\n\nConcrete subclasses MUST declare TIn \/ TOut for downstream type\ninference (PHP cannot enforce templates at the interface level, so\nconcrete impls restate types via docblock).\";}}s:4:\"type\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeType:TYPE_CLASS\";s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:45:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Ddd\\Core\\Policy\\AbstractPolicy\";}s:8:\"inherits\";a:0:{}s:12:\"dependencies\";a:6:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:45:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Ddd\\Core\\Policy\\ComposedPolicy\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:58:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-ddd-core\/src\/Policy\/AbstractPolicy.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:54;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";E:54:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyType:NEW\";}}i:1;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:45:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Ddd\\Core\\Policy\\AbstractPolicy\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:58