:62:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\TaggedTokenReference\u0000tags\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:884:\"\n\nThread-safe transport backed by Swoole\\Thread\\Queue.\n\nsend()  \u2014 pushes Envelope to target worker's Queue. Thread\\Queue serializes\n          the object internally via php_serialize; no explicit serializer needed.\n\nlisten() \u2014 registers a handler and spawns an adaptive-poll coroutine that\n           reads from this worker's own Queue. Thread\\Queue::pop() blocks the\n           entire OS thread, so pop(0) (non-blocking) is used with Coroutine::sleep()\n           backoff to remain coroutine-friendly.\n\nAdaptive poll backoff (Swoole minimum sleep is 1 ms):\n  - Messages present    \u2192 continue immediately (no sleep, tight drain loop)\n  - 1\u201399 empty polls    \u2192 1ms sleep  (recently active, check again soon)\n  - 100\u2013999 empty polls \u2192 5ms sleep\n  - 1000+ empty polls   \u2192 10ms sleep (idle steady state)\n  - Message arrives     \u2192 reset counter, return to tight drain loop\";}}s:4:\"type\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeType:TYPE_CLASS\";s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:63:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\WorkerPool\\Swoole\\Transport\\ThreadQueueTransport\";}s:8:\"inherits\";a:1:{i:0;O:46:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInherit\":4:{s:13:\"classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:51:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\WorkerPool\\Transport\\WorkerTransport\";}s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:77:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-worker-pool-swoole\/src\/Transport\/ThreadQueueT